category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libbenchmark-devel libcivetweb-cpp-devel libcivetweb-devel libcurl-devel libgmock-devel libgtest-devel zlib-devel
sdesc: "Prometheus Client Library for Modern C++ (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This library aims to enable Metrics-Driven Development for C++ services. It
implements the Prometheus Data Model, a powerful abstraction on which to
collect and expose metrics. We offer the possibility for metrics to be
collected by Prometheus, but other push/pull collections can be added as
plugins."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/jupp0r/prometheus-cpp
license: MIT AND 0BSD
